One of the most important lessons is that sometimes in a big fight, 
rather than continuing to hack away, you need to stop, carefully look 
over your inventory (including spells!) and decide what you can use.

I used to hack away all the time until death, often dying with decent 
wands or spells.  Learning to calm down and take stock is one of the most 
important lessons.

